{"seq":1,"slug":"sum-and-product-types","title":"和类型与积类型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/functional-programming/algebraic-types/sum-and-product-types","wordCount":952,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"和类型与积类型\">和类型与积类型</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>代数数据类型</strong>（ADT）用两种算术运算描述类型：加法构造<strong>和类型</strong>（&quot;或&quot;），乘法构造<strong>积类型</strong>（&quot;与&quot;）。取值数量按同样规则相加、相乘，于是类型建模获得了像代数一样严密的推理能力。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>取值数量</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>和类型</td>\n<td>值是其变体之一</td>\n<td>各变体数量之和</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>积类型</td>\n<td>值同时包含所有字段</td>\n<td>各字段数量之积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代数定律</td>\n<td>类型运算满足交换律、分配律、幂律</td>\n<td>与自然数同构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>零类型 / 单位类型</td>\n<td><code>Never</code> 0 个值、<code>void</code> 1 个值</td>\n<td>加法零元 / 乘法单位元</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>建模实践</td>\n<td>用和类型精确描述有限可能性</td>\n<td>让非法状态不可表达</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>ADT 的威力在于&quot;数量即约束&quot;：<code>A + B</code> 排除同时存在的可能，<code>A × B</code> 排除缺失字段的可能。两者组合，就能把业务规则写进类型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代数数据类型概述\">代数数据类型概述</h2><p><strong>代数数据类型</strong>（Algebraic Data Type，ADT）用代数运算来描述类型的构造方式。&quot;代数&quot;意味着类型的可能取值数量可以通过加法和乘法计算得出。这套体系让类型建模变得既精确又系统化。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"data Bool = True | False           -- 和类型：2 个值&#10;&#10;data Pair a b = MkPair a b        -- 积类型：|a| × |b| 个值&#10;&#10;data Maybe a = Nothing | Just a   -- 和类型 + 积类型：1 + |a| 个值\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data Bool = True | False           -- 和类型：2 个值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data Pair a b = MkPair a b        -- 积类型：|a| × |b| 个值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data Maybe a = Nothing | Just a   -- 和类型 + 积类型：1 + |a| 个值</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"type Bool = true | false; // 和类型：2 个值&#10;&#10;type Pair&lt;A, B&gt; = { fst: A; snd: B }; // 积类型：|A| × |B| 个值&#10;&#10;type Maybe&lt;A&gt; = { tag: &#39;nothing&#39; } | { tag: &#39;just&#39;; value: A };\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Bool</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 和类型：2 个值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Pair</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">B</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">fst</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">snd</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> B</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 积类型：|A| × |B| 个值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Maybe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">tag</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'nothing'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">tag</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'just'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span></code></pre></div><p>| 运算      | 类型构造   | 值的数量 | 类比   |\n| --------- | ---------- | -------- | ------ | --- | --- | --- | -------- |\n| 加法（+） | 和类型     | <code>       | A      | +   | B   |</code>   | 逻辑 OR  |\n| 乘法（×） | 积类型     | <code>       | A      | ×   | B   |</code>   | 逻辑 AND |\n| 幂（^）   | 函数类型   | <code>       | B      | ^   | A   |</code>   | 映射     |\n| 0         | Never/Void | 0 个值   | 不可能 |\n| 1         | Unit/void  | 1 个值   | 无信息 |</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    ADT[&quot;代数数据类型&quot;] --&gt; SUM[&quot;和类型&lt;br/&gt;A | B&quot;]&#10;    ADT --&gt; PRODUCT[&quot;积类型&lt;br/&gt;A &amp; B&quot;]&#10;    SUM --&gt; ENUM[&quot;枚举&quot;]&#10;    SUM --&gt; VARIANT[&quot;变体/标签联合&quot;]&#10;    PRODUCT --&gt; TUPLE[&quot;元组&quot;]&#10;    PRODUCT --&gt; RECORD[&quot;记录/结构体&quot;]\">graph TD\n    ADT[\"代数数据类型\"] --&gt; SUM[\"和类型&lt;br/&gt;A | B\"]\n    ADT --&gt; PRODUCT[\"积类型&lt;br/&gt;A &amp; B\"]\n    SUM --&gt; ENUM[\"枚举\"]\n    SUM --&gt; VARIANT[\"变体/标签联合\"]\n    PRODUCT --&gt; TUPLE[\"元组\"]\n    PRODUCT --&gt; RECORD[\"记录/结构体\"]</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 为什么叫&quot;代数&quot;数据类型？因为类型的取值空间遵循与自然数相同的代数规律。比如分配律 <code>A × (B + C) = A × B + A × C</code> 在类型层面完全成立。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"和类型\">和类型</h2><p><strong>和类型</strong>（Sum Type）表示一个值可以是几种类型中的某一种——&quot;这个或那个&quot;。它的取值空间是各成员取值空间之和。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"data Shape&#10;  = Circle Double&#10;  | Rectangle Double Double&#10;  | Triangle Double Double Double&#10;&#10;data Color = Red | Green | Blue  -- 3 个值\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data Shape</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  = Circle Double</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Rectangle Double Double</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Triangle Double Double Double</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data Color = Red | Green | Blue  -- 3 个值</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"type Shape =&#10;  | { kind: &#39;circle&#39;; radius: number }&#10;  | { kind: &#39;rectangle&#39;; width: number; height: number }&#10;  | { kind: &#39;triangle&#39;; a: number; b: number; c: number };&#10;&#10;type Direction = &#39;north&#39; | &#39;south&#39; | &#39;east&#39; | &#39;west&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Shape</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'circle'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">radius</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'rectangle'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">width</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">height</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'triangle'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">c</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Direction</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'north'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'south'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'east'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'west'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>| 和类型示例    | 取值数量           | 语言表达方式 |\n| ------------- | ------------------ | ------------ | ---------- | --- | --- | ------- | -------- |\n| <code>Bool</code>        | <code>true + false = 2</code> | 枚举         |\n| <code>Maybe&lt;Bool&gt;</code> | <code>1 + 2 = 3</code>        | <code>Nothing     | Just Bool</code> |\n| <code>Either&lt;A,B&gt;</code> | <code>                 | A            | +          | B   |</code>   | <code>Left A | Right B</code> |\n| <code>Direction</code>   | <code>4</code>                | 字面量联合   |</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;Shape(和类型)&quot;&#10;        S[&quot;Shape&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;是 Circle&quot;| C[&quot;Circle { radius }&quot;]&#10;        S --&gt;|&quot;是 Rectangle&quot;| R[&quot;Rectangle { w, h }&quot;]&#10;        S --&gt;|&quot;是 Triangle&quot;| T[&quot;Triangle { a, b, c }&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph \"Shape(和类型)\"\n        S[\"Shape\"] --&gt;|\"是 Circle\"| C[\"Circle { radius }\"]\n        S --&gt;|\"是 Rectangle\"| R[\"Rectangle { w, h }\"]\n        S --&gt;|\"是 Triangle\"| T[\"Triangle { a, b, c }\"]\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"积类型\">积类型</h2><p><strong>积类型</strong>（Product Type）表示一个值同时包含多个类型的数据——&quot;这个和那个&quot;。它的取值空间是各成员取值空间之积。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"data Point = Point Double Double           -- |Double| × |Double|&#10;&#10;data Person = Person&#10;  { name :: String&#10;  , age  :: Int&#10;  , email :: String&#10;  }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data Point = Point Double Double           -- |Double| × |Double|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data Person = Person</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  { name :: String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  , age  :: Int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  , email :: String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"type Point = { x: number; y: number };&#10;&#10;type Person = {&#10;  name: string;&#10;  age: number;&#10;  email: string;&#10;};&#10;&#10;type Tuple3&lt;A, B, C&gt; = [A, B, C];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Point</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">x</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">y</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Person</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  age</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  email</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Tuple3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">B</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">C</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">B</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">C</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><p>| 积类型示例            | 取值数量    | 结构   |\n| --------------------- | ----------- | ------ | --- | ------ | --- | ---- |\n| <code>(Bool, Bool)</code>        | <code>2 × 2 = 4</code> | 元组   |\n| <code>{ x: Bool, y: Bool}</code> | <code>2 × 2 = 4</code> | 记录   |\n| <code>(Bool, Direction)</code>   | <code>2 × 4 = 8</code> | 元组   |\n| <code>Point</code>               | <code>          | number | ×   | number |</code>   | 记录 |</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph &quot;Person(积类型)&quot;&#10;        P[&quot;Person&quot;] --&gt; N[&quot;name: string&quot;]&#10;        P --&gt; A[&quot;age: number&quot;]&#10;        P --&gt; E[&quot;email: string&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph \"Person(积类型)\"\n        P[\"Person\"] --&gt; N[\"name: string\"]\n        P --&gt; A[\"age: number\"]\n        P --&gt; E[\"email: string\"]\n    end</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 对象/结构体/记录都是积类型。TypeScript 的 <code>interface</code> 和 <code>type</code> 对象字面量本质上都在定义积类型——一个值必须同时包含所有声明的字段。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"代数定律\">代数定律</h2><p>类型的代数运算遵循与自然数相同的定律：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 分配律：A × (B | C) ≅ (A × B) | (A × C)&#10;type Left&lt;A, B, C&gt; = { a: A; bc: B | C };&#10;type Right&lt;A, B, C&gt; = { a: A; bc: B } | { a: A; bc: C };&#10;&#10;// 幂律：(A → B) → C ≅ A → B → C&#10;type Curried&lt;A, B, C&gt; = (a: A) =&gt; (b: B) =&gt; C;&#10;type Uncurried&lt;A, B, C&gt; = (ab: [A, B]) =&gt; C;&#10;&#10;// 单位元：A × 1 ≅ A，A + 0 ≅ A&#10;type WithUnit = { value: string; unit: void };&#10;type WithNever = string | never;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 分配律：A × (B | C) ≅ (A × B) | (A × C)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Left</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">B</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"